From fa07d8484a8f0c380d962395d11d9493e66bdb5e Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Tendai Makumire <121951760+tmakumire@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Fri, 7 Feb 2025 15:10:06 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Initial bringup of IMDT Display (#3)

This PR adds support for the
IMDT 7inch (TST070WSBE-165C) custom display
made by Team Source Display (TSD).
The display controller for this display is the
EK79007AD which does not need much configuration.
It already has a gamma table pre-loaded.
TSD have sent us some configuration settings
for a few gamma registers but I have not added them
to the device tree as it didn't seem necessary.

The touch IC for this 7inch display is the GT911.
I have not yet added support for the touch controller.

The DSI timing register values have been calculated
using the DSI Timing Paramters User Interactive
spreadsheet from Qualcomm.

Note that some of the GPIO's we are using
are incorret. This is because there is a mistake
in the HW for the display adapter connector.

- GPIO_123 (I2S1_WS) for 10_1PWR_EN
- GPIO_121 (I2S1_SCK) for 10_Inch_Display_PWM

And we also now need to enable the 5V reg
which powers the display backlight PMIC.
This is controlled via GPIO_140.
